To get started just configure it in your mcp servers.<p>JSON:
{
  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {
    &quot;agent-hub&quot;: {
      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,
      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;agent-hub-mcp@latest&quot;]
    }
  }
}<p>TOML:
[mcp_servers.agent-hub]
command = &quot;npx&quot;
args = [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;agent-hub-mcp@latest&quot;]
